                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The head of a Sunday school."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ccebde3d-2002-308b-82bb-26e04de07a8a",
                                        "entry_id": "459874e3-047f-39dc-83da-21007777c074",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In some Protestant churches, a clergyman having the oversight of the clergy of a district."
